WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.800
Safex

00:00:03.003 --> 00:00:07.165
Candy went back to Pony's Home, from where
she had been away for a long time.

00:00:07.315 --> 00:00:11.267
She brushes past Terry.

00:00:12.212 --> 00:00:18.009
Candy understood that
Terry wants to earn his own living.

00:00:18.159 --> 00:00:23.215
She makes a decision for herself
that she can't be defeated by Terry.

00:00:24.224 --> 00:00:27.591
One day as a naughty teacher.

00:00:47.947 --> 00:00:50.245
Here.

00:00:56.389 --> 00:00:57.686
Kurin.

00:01:08.101 --> 00:01:09.693
Are you okay, Kurin?

00:01:14.074 --> 00:01:18.443
Candy,
sister Pony's looking for you!

00:01:18.678 --> 00:01:21.340
Ok. That's the end of today.

00:01:22.549 --> 00:01:24.943
Stay at home alone?

00:01:25.093 --> 00:01:27.879
No, with the other children.

00:01:28.029 --> 00:01:31.720
Sister Pony and I
have to attend a meeting.

00:01:32.492 --> 00:01:36.788
To thank those people who helped us.

00:01:36.938 --> 00:01:40.558
Go ahead! Leave everything to me!

00:01:40.708 --> 00:01:43.461
That's great!

00:01:43.611 --> 00:01:46.903
Candy is not a girl anymore.
You're a lady now.

00:01:48.174 --> 00:01:50.335
It's embarrassing.

00:01:50.485 --> 00:01:52.275
-Please, then.
-Ok.

00:01:52.745 --> 00:01:56.977
I'll be your teacher today,
nice to meet you.

00:01:59.252 --> 00:02:02.187
It would be funny today.

00:02:05.992 --> 00:02:08.984
I'm a teacher,
how can you do this to me?

00:02:09.596 --> 00:02:12.457
Just for fun.

00:02:12.607 --> 00:02:15.160
Just for fun?

00:02:15.310 --> 00:02:16.964
You bad...

00:02:21.941 --> 00:02:26.270
So, do you want to be hostile to me?

00:02:26.420 --> 00:02:29.212
Attack! Everybody!

00:02:36.089 --> 00:02:39.146
There is somebody in the house.

00:02:39.296 --> 00:02:41.252
Why don't you play with everybody?

00:02:41.402 --> 00:02:42.821
Daisy can't come out.

00:02:42.971 --> 00:02:44.155
Why?

00:02:44.305 --> 00:02:46.320
She is uncomfortable.

00:02:46.470 --> 00:02:48.159
Uncomfortable... where?

00:02:48.309 --> 00:02:50.828
I don't know. Watch out!

00:02:56.843 --> 00:03:00.574
Candy, over here quickly!

00:03:00.980 --> 00:03:02.948
Just a moment.

00:03:03.783 --> 00:03:06.343
Won't you come out
to play with the others?

00:03:19.098 --> 00:03:22.499
Daisy! You can't hide indoor forever.

00:03:23.002 --> 00:03:24.829
Can I go out?

00:03:24.979 --> 00:03:26.667
Certainly!

00:03:37.350 --> 00:03:39.284
Teacher, we're ready.

00:03:40.186 --> 00:03:43.121
Ready! Start to climb the tree!

00:03:48.361 --> 00:03:50.488
Keep the distance!

00:04:03.409 --> 00:04:05.206
Kurin's the winner!

00:04:07.947 --> 00:04:10.175
Daisy, do you want to climb the tree?

00:04:10.325 --> 00:04:11.809
I can't.

00:04:11.959 --> 00:04:14.345
Nobody can climb trees initially.

00:04:14.495 --> 00:04:19.414
When I was a child,
there was a girl just like you.

00:04:19.726 --> 00:04:21.717
Her name is Annie.

00:04:23.663 --> 00:04:26.257
Annie was timid.

00:04:26.407 --> 00:04:30.393
After practicing,
she climbed up the big tree at last.

00:04:30.770 --> 00:04:34.831
We sat on the tree together,
looking at the beautiful world.

00:04:38.511 --> 00:04:40.438
Teacher, I'd like to try.

00:04:40.588 --> 00:04:42.481
Let's go.

00:04:42.715 --> 00:04:45.743
- Daisy can't do this.
- No.

00:04:45.893 --> 00:04:46.744
Why?

00:04:46.894 --> 00:04:49.280
If she gets hurt,
sister Pony will be angry.

00:04:49.430 --> 00:04:53.849
Don't worry, I'm good at tree climbing.

00:04:54.127 --> 00:04:56.527
Daisy, take a deep breath!

00:05:01.034 --> 00:05:04.162
Let's challenge it. Step on my back.

00:05:04.312 --> 00:05:06.330
- But...
- Come.

00:05:08.775 --> 00:05:10.802
Launch your hands and help her.

00:05:10.952 --> 00:05:13.175
Here, give me your hand.

00:05:17.283 --> 00:05:18.610
Daisy is coming up.

00:05:18.760 --> 00:05:20.983
Try yourself from there.

00:05:21.754 --> 00:05:24.222
You must do it by yourself.

00:05:26.459 --> 00:05:29.754
Go! Daisy, do your best!

00:05:29.904 --> 00:05:31.524
Yes, teacher.

00:05:35.335 --> 00:05:37.599
Daisy, do your best!

00:05:41.341 --> 00:05:44.401
Daisy, do your best!

00:05:45.912 --> 00:05:47.572
Daisy, are you ok?

00:05:47.722 --> 00:05:49.308
I am fine.

00:05:56.155 --> 00:05:59.352
- Daisy, do your best!
- You're almost there!

00:05:59.859 --> 00:06:00.852
Daisy!

00:06:01.002 --> 00:06:03.327
Daisy, do your best!

00:06:18.044 --> 00:06:20.945
- Daisy, are you ok?
- I'm fine.

00:06:27.954 --> 00:06:30.388
Daisy, you made it!

00:06:38.398 --> 00:06:40.458
Daisy, well done!

00:06:40.608 --> 00:06:43.194
Teacher...

00:06:43.344 --> 00:06:47.799
It's like a dream,
sitting here watching Pony's Home.

00:06:47.949 --> 00:06:50.868
Where there is a will,
there is a way.

00:06:51.018 --> 00:06:54.174
Yes! I feel like a bird.

00:06:54.580 --> 00:06:55.940
A bird?

00:06:56.090 --> 00:07:00.213
Birds always enjoy the scenery
from a big height.

00:07:00.453 --> 00:07:01.512
It makes sense.

00:07:01.662 --> 00:07:04.215
Pony's Home looks like a dream land.

00:07:04.365 --> 00:07:07.085
Daisy, shout loudly!

00:07:07.235 --> 00:07:08.219
How?

00:07:08.369 --> 00:07:11.058
Like this...

00:07:13.800 --> 00:07:15.392
Louder!

00:07:18.905 --> 00:07:22.170
Daisy shouted so loudly.

00:07:27.480 --> 00:07:28.906
Mr. Matthew!

00:07:29.056 --> 00:07:31.142
Mr. Matthew!

00:07:31.292 --> 00:07:33.515
Mr. Matthew!

00:07:35.288 --> 00:07:37.950
Mr. Matthew!

00:07:39.091 --> 00:07:41.992
It's Candy, still so naughty.

00:07:44.397 --> 00:07:46.627
That one next to her...

00:07:47.066 --> 00:07:49.466
Daisy! It's Daisy!

00:07:49.936 --> 00:07:54.332
Candy! Stop that! Daisy's sick!

00:07:54.482 --> 00:07:57.168
Candy, Let her down, Quickly!

00:07:57.318 --> 00:08:00.671
Mr. Mathew, you want to come up?
It feels so good up here.

00:08:00.821 --> 00:08:02.475
Isn't that right, Daisy?

00:08:02.815 --> 00:08:04.442
Daisy!

00:08:05.985 --> 00:08:10.046
It's alright!
I climbed the tree for the first time...

00:08:10.289 --> 00:08:13.518
What's the matter? Daisy!

00:08:13.668 --> 00:08:16.921
Candy, Daisy's fainted!
Everybody come to help!

00:08:17.071 --> 00:08:18.759
Yes!

00:08:29.609 --> 00:08:32.737
Fortunately, she is not hurt.

00:08:32.887 --> 00:08:34.575
What disease is she suffering from?

00:08:35.214 --> 00:08:36.772
Hemophilia.

00:08:37.984 --> 00:08:39.343
Hemophilia?

00:08:39.493 --> 00:08:43.946
If she injured,
the blood will flow incessantly.

00:08:44.156 --> 00:08:47.353
You shouldn’t have let her
climb the tree.

00:08:48.594 --> 00:08:51.122
I didn't know that.

00:08:51.272 --> 00:08:55.065
You must not let her climb the tree.

00:08:55.568 --> 00:09:00.471
Daisy can't climb the tree,
she should know that.

00:09:02.308 --> 00:09:05.436
Daisy, I am sorry for that.

00:09:05.586 --> 00:09:08.207
Bird! I want to be a bird!

00:09:08.481 --> 00:09:11.242
Daisy, the doctor's coming now.

00:09:11.392 --> 00:09:13.842
Looks like she has a fever.

00:09:14.287 --> 00:09:16.687
Teacher... Candy...

00:09:20.326 --> 00:09:24.888
Daisy, I'm not a good teacher.

00:09:26.632 --> 00:09:29.362
The doctor's coming. Hurry up!

00:09:31.237 --> 00:09:33.228
- Mr. Matthew!
- Please, doctor!

00:09:33.906 --> 00:09:35.965
- Any injuries?
- No.

00:09:36.876 --> 00:09:39.106
Candy
help me to open the suitcase.

00:09:39.412 --> 00:09:41.105
How is Daisy, doctor?

00:09:41.255 --> 00:09:43.808
There is no life danger.

00:09:49.889 --> 00:09:52.824
Doctor,
the hemophilia is really hopeless?

00:09:53.359 --> 00:09:57.386
At present,
there's no suitable treatment.

00:09:57.630 --> 00:10:02.033
This kind of disease
usually happens to adults.

00:10:02.301 --> 00:10:05.099
She's so young, what a pity!

00:10:05.738 --> 00:10:07.899
Well, I should leave now.

00:10:08.708 --> 00:10:10.767
Thank you, Mr. Matthew.

00:10:10.977 --> 00:10:14.272
It's nothing.
We should help each other.

00:10:14.422 --> 00:10:19.114
But, Mr. Matthew, weren't you
coming here to deliver the letters?

00:10:19.552 --> 00:10:20.780
That's right!

00:10:25.725 --> 00:10:27.886
Candy, a letter from London.

00:10:29.362 --> 00:10:30.659
From London?

00:10:31.931 --> 00:10:33.672
It's from Annie!

00:10:33.822 --> 00:10:36.233
The teacher's friend?

00:10:36.702 --> 00:10:39.102
Daisy, you have woken up!

00:10:46.912 --> 00:10:52.910
Candy, I don't know
if you are at Pony's Home or not.

00:10:53.060 --> 00:10:55.046
So I wrote this letter.

00:10:55.196 --> 00:10:57.954
London is foggy now.

00:10:58.557 --> 00:11:00.957
The St. Paul academy is also.

00:11:01.494 --> 00:11:06.989
The fog came deep inside
to the heart of Patty and I.

00:11:09.101 --> 00:11:11.797
Stear and Archie became listless.

00:11:12.405 --> 00:11:16.899
The school became lonely without you.

00:11:17.677 --> 00:11:21.340
Your seat is still empty.

00:11:22.048 --> 00:11:27.987
Patty and I hoping that
someone can fill in that vacancy.

00:11:28.587 --> 00:11:31.385
Every time I look at that vacant seat,

00:11:31.724 --> 00:11:35.956
I miss you so much,
that the tears flow without end.

00:11:37.196 --> 00:11:42.361
Candy, if you receive this letter,
please write back as soon as possible.

00:11:43.035 --> 00:11:46.471
Please tell me your whereabouts,
Annie.

00:11:48.974 --> 00:11:51.067
- Annie.
- How nice!

00:11:52.044 --> 00:11:53.938
The teacher's friend?

00:11:54.088 --> 00:11:57.847
That's right,
Daisy will have a good friend, too.

00:11:58.784 --> 00:12:00.077
No way!

00:12:00.227 --> 00:12:01.312
Why?

00:12:01.462 --> 00:12:04.220
- I am sick.
- It doesn't matter.

00:12:04.757 --> 00:12:06.250
I can't play with everybody.

00:12:06.400 --> 00:12:09.260
Even if you can't play with others,
you can still have friends.

00:12:09.628 --> 00:12:12.096
Didn't Annie ever play with you?

00:12:12.631 --> 00:12:13.824
This...

00:12:13.974 --> 00:12:16.959
You played together all the time.

00:12:18.337 --> 00:12:20.498
I can't even play with others.

00:12:21.941 --> 00:12:23.568
Daisy.

00:12:25.177 --> 00:12:27.304
You're back, sister Pony.

00:12:27.947 --> 00:12:29.974
Thank you, Mr. Morely.

00:12:30.124 --> 00:12:31.880
Good-bye, sister.

00:12:32.685 --> 00:12:33.811
What happened to Daisy?

00:12:33.961 --> 00:12:35.854
Something happened.

00:12:41.227 --> 00:12:45.690
I am sorry,
I didn't know Daisy is sick.

00:12:45.840 --> 00:12:49.293
No, It's our fault.

00:12:49.443 --> 00:12:52.430
You have no idea about her condition.

00:12:52.580 --> 00:12:57.533
Daisy's so sick,
why did she try to climb the tree?

00:12:58.244 --> 00:13:02.506
Maybe we should tell the children
about Daisy's situation.

00:13:02.656 --> 00:13:05.175
Yes, In case of she got injured...

00:13:07.286 --> 00:13:08.776
Who is it?

00:13:15.728 --> 00:13:17.286
Daisy!

00:13:18.964 --> 00:13:21.762
What are you doing?

00:13:22.067 --> 00:13:23.500
You should stay in bed.

00:13:24.036 --> 00:13:27.995
Sister Pony, sister Lane,
please don't blame Candy teacher.

00:13:31.310 --> 00:13:32.670
Daisy !

00:13:32.820 --> 00:13:35.272
No! We didn't!

00:13:35.422 --> 00:13:36.837
That's great!

00:13:37.349 --> 00:13:39.110
Come back to your room now.

00:13:39.260 --> 00:13:42.018
- Will you stay with me?
- Certainly.

00:13:52.698 --> 00:13:55.428
Daisy, are you asleep already?

00:13:55.768 --> 00:13:58.262
No, I can't sleep.

00:13:58.412 --> 00:13:59.797
Why?

00:13:59.947 --> 00:14:02.136
I'm trying to remember
the scenery on the tree.

00:14:10.449 --> 00:14:13.410
Teacher,
can I see that scenery tomorrow?

00:14:13.560 --> 00:14:16.318
You can see that every day.

00:14:16.789 --> 00:14:19.485
I'd like to become a bird
one more time.

00:14:38.177 --> 00:14:39.872
She's up already?

00:14:40.079 --> 00:14:42.445
Good morning!

00:14:43.182 --> 00:14:44.581
Good morning!

00:14:46.285 --> 00:14:47.752
It is cold.

00:14:48.220 --> 00:14:50.514
You must clean your face.

00:14:50.664 --> 00:14:53.050
-Good morning, everybody.
-Good morning!

00:14:53.200 --> 00:14:54.885
Where is Daisy?

00:14:55.035 --> 00:14:57.154
- I don't know.
- I don't know either.

00:14:57.304 --> 00:14:58.662
Nobody knows.

00:14:58.931 --> 00:15:00.457
Toilet maybe!

00:15:00.607 --> 00:15:01.999
Candy, what happened?

00:15:02.368 --> 00:15:04.336
I can't find Daisy.

00:15:04.503 --> 00:15:05.936
Daisy?

00:15:08.807 --> 00:15:09.739
Kurin!

00:15:17.583 --> 00:15:19.574
Have you found her?

00:15:36.368 --> 00:15:37.628
Daisy!

00:15:37.778 --> 00:15:39.136
Come down!

00:15:39.305 --> 00:15:41.239
You do it by yourself, Daisy?

00:15:41.674 --> 00:15:43.972
That's right, I can see the scenery now.

00:15:44.276 --> 00:15:46.642
The place where the sun rises.

00:15:47.379 --> 00:15:49.609
It's so beautiful.

00:15:52.251 --> 00:15:54.151
Candy, go help her.

00:16:06.532 --> 00:16:08.830
Daisy!

00:16:13.639 --> 00:16:16.472
It would be awful,
if the blood keep flowing.

00:16:16.742 --> 00:16:20.337
Awful?
Isn't there styptic medicine?

00:16:20.487 --> 00:16:22.473
I have already done my best.

00:16:22.623 --> 00:16:25.309
Please, doctor.

00:16:25.459 --> 00:16:29.252
There's nothing else I can do.
Climbing the tree...

00:16:29.621 --> 00:16:31.348
It's all my fault!

00:16:31.498 --> 00:16:32.947
Candy!

00:16:33.792 --> 00:16:35.089
Daisy!

00:16:35.361 --> 00:16:37.852
- What should we do ?
- She keeps bleeding ?

00:16:38.430 --> 00:16:40.090
The doctor said...

00:16:40.240 --> 00:16:45.068
if she loses 1/3 of her blood,
her life could be in danger.

00:16:45.537 --> 00:16:47.627
Will Daisy die?

00:16:47.777 --> 00:16:49.297
If she keeps on bleeding...

00:16:50.142 --> 00:16:53.236
It’s such a pity,
what should we do?

00:16:54.346 --> 00:16:55.506
I got it!

00:16:56.949 --> 00:16:59.376
We can give her our blood.

00:16:59.526 --> 00:17:02.352
- That's right!
- I'll do that.

00:17:02.688 --> 00:17:04.588
Count me in.

00:17:05.024 --> 00:17:06.784
Let's talk to the doctor.

00:17:06.934 --> 00:17:08.486
No way!

00:17:08.994 --> 00:17:10.387
It won't work.

00:17:10.537 --> 00:17:12.453
Sister Lane!

00:17:12.664 --> 00:17:13.991
Why can't we?

00:17:14.141 --> 00:17:16.360
We don't know your blood type.

00:17:16.510 --> 00:17:20.371
You can't do blood transfusion
with the wrong blood type.

00:17:20.639 --> 00:17:22.766
How can we have the blood type test?

00:17:23.342 --> 00:17:26.641
We don't have the equipment
in the village.

00:17:26.879 --> 00:17:28.639
And Daisy...

00:17:28.789 --> 00:17:30.941
She will be fine. Come!

00:17:31.091 --> 00:17:34.545
Let's pray to God for Daisy's recovery.

00:17:34.695 --> 00:17:35.746
Okay!

00:17:35.896 --> 00:17:37.686
Let's pray.

00:17:59.178 --> 00:18:03.941
This kind of wound
would never hurt any common people.

00:18:04.091 --> 00:18:07.110
Why is there this kind of disease
in the world?

00:18:14.726 --> 00:18:18.989
Candy, take some rest,
I'll deal with it.

00:18:19.139 --> 00:18:20.895
No, I'm fine.

00:18:40.185 --> 00:18:43.780
You can't stop the prayer,
Daisy's in danger.

00:18:45.390 --> 00:18:47.858
God, I am sorry.

00:18:48.227 --> 00:18:51.094
You're still a baby, York, go to bed!

00:18:51.396 --> 00:18:53.023
I'm okay.

00:19:07.679 --> 00:19:09.010
It's stopped.

00:19:10.048 --> 00:19:11.675
Sister Pony!

00:19:13.118 --> 00:19:16.610
Just let her sleep, it's okay now!

00:19:18.490 --> 00:19:20.219
Thank you!

00:19:20.759 --> 00:19:24.559
That's great!

00:19:25.531 --> 00:19:27.999
That's great, Daisy!

00:19:31.637 --> 00:19:35.232
Do you hear that, Daisy?
They are all your friends.

00:19:35.774 --> 00:19:37.401
My friends?

00:19:37.609 --> 00:19:40.271
Yes, all are your friends.

00:19:40.445 --> 00:19:45.348
They pray for you all night.
They are your friends.

00:19:46.185 --> 00:19:50.281
They're willing to give you their blood,
they are your friends.

00:19:52.558 --> 00:19:56.119
Candy teacher,
I climbed the tree by myself.

00:19:56.328 --> 00:19:59.559
Yes, and you saw the sunrise.

00:20:07.139 --> 00:20:09.733
Candy teacher!

00:20:09.883 --> 00:20:13.170
Go write the letter
to your friend in London.

00:20:13.320 --> 00:20:17.773
It's already done,
I won't upset my good friend.

00:20:36.735 --> 00:20:41.229
I never knew that
Daisy can sing so loud.

00:20:41.807 --> 00:20:45.869
Candy,
you are my teacher this time.

00:20:46.019 --> 00:20:47.434
Sister Pony.

00:20:48.013 --> 00:20:53.977
We've been protecting her too much.

00:20:54.127 --> 00:20:58.648
She had lost her confidence in life.

00:21:01.226 --> 00:21:04.684
Candy keeps thinking...

00:21:05.030 --> 00:21:08.989
Her carelessness
had almost killed Daisy.

00:21:09.368 --> 00:21:16.166
There are all kinds of terrible diseases
in the world.

00:21:16.316 --> 00:21:19.768
Candy keeps it in her heart...
